  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Bring a medium saucepan of water to the boil. Finely chop or crush garlic. Thinly slice carrot (unpeeled) into half-moons. Cut zucchini into thin batons.\n• In a small bowl, combine garlic, hoisin sauce, soy sauce, honey and water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5f2a339f0ea49b7d7133914b/step-965b3e4f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cook udon noodles (see ingredients list) in boiling water until just tender, 8-10 mins. Drain and refresh under cold water.\n• Lightly drizzle with olive oil to prevent noodles sticking together.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5f2a339f0ea49b7d7133914b/step-d7f100dc.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. When oil is hot, stir-fry carrot and zucchini until tender, 6-7 mins. TIP: Add a splash of water to speed up the cooking.\n• Transfer to a medium bowl and cover to keep warm.\n• Cut tofu into 1cm pieces. In a medium bowl, combine tofu and plain flour and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5f2a339f0ea49b7d7133914b/step-8aaffe70.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a good drizzle of olive oil. When oil is hot, cook tofu in batches (shake off excess flour) until golden, 5-7 mins. Return tofu to pan and add sauce mixture, noodles and veggies. Toss to coat.\n• Divide hoisin tofu noodles between bowls and top with peanuts.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5f2a339f0ea49b7d7133914b/step-841d3fa7.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
